@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. GET semua konser
GET {{baseUrl}}/concerts

### 2. GET detail konser berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/concerts/1

### 3. POST tambah konser baru (Valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/concerts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Jazz Festival",
  "artist": "Maliq & D'Essentials",
  "category": "Lokal",
  "date": "2027-03-07",
  "time": "20:00",
  "location": "JIExpo Kemayoran, Jakarta",
  "ticketPrice": 550000,
  "preSale": "2027-01-15",
  "generalSale": "2027-01-25",
  "status": "Tersedia",
  "description": "Festival musik jazz tahunan di Jakarta dengan penampilan musisi lokal dan mancanegara."
}

### 4. PATCH ubah konser (ID 4)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/concerts/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketPrice": 650000,
  "status": "Segera hadir"
}

### 5. DELETE hapus konser (ID 4)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/concerts/4

### 6. [Error Test] Input tidak valid (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/concerts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AB",
  "artist": "",
  "category": "Indie",
  "date": "bukan-tanggal",
  "location": "JKT",
  "ticketPrice": -50000,
  "status": "Unknown"
}

### 7. [Error Test] Data duplikat nama dan tanggal (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/concerts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Semesta Berpesta",
  "artist": "Tulus",
  "category": "Lokal",
  "date": "2026-11-21",
  "location": "Stadion Madya, Jakarta",
  "ticketPrice": 250000,
  "status": "Tersedia"
}

### 8. [Error Test] GET ID tidak ditemukan (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/concerts/999

### 9. [Error Test] PATCH ID tidak ditemukan (404 Not Found)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/concerts/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Habis"
}

### 10. [Error Test] DELETE ID tidak ditemukan (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/concerts/999

